Trace test note: the existing internal/tracing/span.go captures
`var tracer = otel.Tracer("teslasync")` at package init time. OTel's
global tracer delegate locks to the first installed TracerProvider,
so per-test SetTracerProvider would silently drop spans for tests
after the first. Solved with a TestMain that installs one shared
in-memory exporter; each test calls Reset() at start.

