=== PROVISIONAL DEFAULTS ===

These constants are introduced in internal/ai/provider/config.go and
surfaced for owner ack per the methodology mandatory metadata rule.
They are the single-source defaults reused by F2 (Settings UI), F7
(embeddings worker), and any feature that does not pin its own
provider override.

PD1 — local default model
  Constant: provider.DefaultLocalModel
  Value:    "llama3.1:8b-instruct-q4_K_M"
  Reason:   8B llama3.1 instruct quantized to ~6 GB; fits a consumer
            GPU with headroom and is responsive on Apple Silicon /
            mid-range Linux GPUs. Supports tool calls (model-dependent).

PD2 — cloud default flavour
  Constants: provider.DefaultCloudBaseURL = "https://api.openai.com"
             provider.DefaultCloudModel   = "gpt-4o-mini"
  Reason:    OpenAI-compatible surface — the same wire format works
             for vLLM, LiteLLM, Together, Groq, Azure OpenAI,
             Cloudflare Workers AI by overriding base_url. gpt-4o-mini
             is small + tool-capable + JSON-mode capable + low cost.

PD3 — embeddings defaults
  Constants: provider.DefaultLocalEmbeddingModel = "nomic-embed-text"
             provider.DefaultCloudEmbeddingModel = "text-embedding-3-small"
  Reason:    Local: 768-dim, dense, fast. Cloud: matches PD2 cost
             tier (cheap, 1536-dim).

Owner ack: PENDING. The values land in the codebase as defaults; if
the owner objects, the change is one constant per default and
propagates through ParseProviderConfig.applyDefaults to every caller.

